sequenceDiagram
    actor User as пользователь
    participant CLI as lama.c<br/>CLI
    participant VM as vm.c
    participant Loader as loader.c<br/>bytecode.c
    participant Conv as converter.c
    participant Exec as ops.c<br/>runtime

    %% Full CLI form: ./lama.exe [opts] <unit | file.bc> [args]
    User->>CLI: ./lama.exe opts<br/>unit/file.bc args
    activate CLI
    CLI->>VM: vm_create
    activate VM
    VM->>Loader: load
    activate Loader
    Loader-->>VM: загруженные юниты
    deactivate Loader
    VM->>Conv: decode
    activate Conv
    Conv->>Conv: проверка,<br/>связывание,<br/>релокация
    Conv-->>VM: поток инструкций
    deactivate Conv
    CLI->>VM: vm_run
    VM->>Exec: исполнение
    activate Exec
    deactivate Exec
    VM-->>CLI: завершение
    deactivate VM
    deactivate CLI
